# Tasks

## 1. Worktree

- [ ] 1.1 Create the task-owned worktree `.worktrees/widget-cache` on new branch `widget-cache` from `main` (add `.worktrees/` to `.git/info/exclude` in the primary checkout so it stays out of `git status`), and move the session into it; every later task runs there. Verify: `test "$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)" = widget-cache && test "$(basename "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)")" = widget-cache`

## 2. Per-id widget cache with 30-second TTL

